This product is licensed under the MIT licence (LICENSE). Its source is a
translation to Zig of the works below. Each translated file names its
source in its header. The translation keeps the original's checks, defaults
and arithmetic, so that it gives the same results, and changes the
language, the structure needed to express it in Zig, and the public
interface.

