-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
jsmn (src/jsmn.zig)

Translated from the copy of jsmn included in cgltf.h, which names its
source as https://github.com/zserge/jsmn and its licence as MIT. From
jsmn's LICENSE:

    Copyright (c) 2010 Serge A. Zaitsev

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/number.zig

Written for zig-cgltf, not translated: it gives the results of the C
library's atoi, atoll and atof, through which cgltf reads numbers, and its
tests compare it with glibc's.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
reference/

reference/cgltf/ is cgltf at the commit above, unmodified, with its own
LICENSE. It and reference/shim/ are built only for the tests and the
benchmark, and are not part of the package.
